# Cursor agent scope (gui + net)

## Allowed paths (read + write)

- `runtime/gui/**`
- `runtime/net/**`

## Read-only reference

- `runtime/core/*.h`
- `include/casprix.h`

## Do not edit

- `src/**`
- `runtime/ml/**`
- `runtime/ai/**`
- `runtime/android/**` (except coordinated JNI contracts documented in `runtime/gui/gui_bridge.h`)
- Root `CMakeLists.txt` unless explicitly required to register new `runtime/gui` / `runtime/net` sources
- `.github/**`
- Unrelated `include/**` headers

## Cross-scope contracts

- Keep `cpx_gui_surface_attach` signature in `runtime/gui/gui_bridge.h` stable for Android JNI.
- Implement `cpx_gui_training_progress` as a safe no-op unless a HUD backend is registered.
